{:edb/db-before-t 346 :edb/db-after-t 347 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533659 50 #inst "2026-10-04T07:30:05.830Z" 13194139533659 true] [17592186059599 1020 #edb/ref 17592186244851 13194139533659 true] [17592186059599 1020 #edb/ref 17592186244858 13194139533659 true] [17592186059599 1020 #edb/ref 17592186244865 13194139533659 true] [17592186059599 1020 #edb/ref 17592186244872 13194139533659 true] [17592186059599 1020 #edb/ref 17592186244888 13194139533659 true] [17592186059600 1020 #edb/ref 17592186244844 13194139533659 true] [17592186059600 1020 #edb/ref 17592186244875 13194139533659 true] [17592186059600 1020 #edb/ref 17592186244878 13194139533659 true] [17592186059600 1020 #edb/ref 17592186244881 13194139533659 true] [17592186059600 1020 #edb/ref 17592186244895 13194139533659 true] [17592186244844 1017 #edb/ref 17592186244845 13194139533659 true] [17592186244844 1089 "q-17912" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244844 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533659 true] [17592186244844 1100 "Calculate the instantaneous rate of change of the function $f(x)=-tan⁡x$ when $x=\\pi .$" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244844 1113 #uuid "24aac0fa-ecfb-54cd-928d-884ec7fb4d08" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244844 1138 false 13194139533659 true] [17592186244844 1145 "The instantaneous rate of change  when $x=\\pi $ is given by the value of the derivative ${f}^{′}(x)$ at $x=\\pi .$ \n\nFirst, we compute the derivative, using the fact that $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(tan⁡x)={sec}^{2}⁡x.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-tan⁡x) \\\\  & =-{sec}^{2}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=\\pi ,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(\\pi ) & =-{sec}^{2}⁡\\pi  \\\\  & =-1\\cdot (-1)^{2} \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,  the instantaneous rate of change is $-1.$" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244845 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244846 13194139533659 true] [17592186244845 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244847 13194139533659 true] [17592186244845 1000 #edb/