xt{d}x}(cos⁡x)=-sin⁡x.$ Applying these formulas, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4cos⁡x+2sin⁡x) & =4(-sin⁡x)+2(cos⁡x) \\\\  & =2cos⁡x-4sin⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244852 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244853 13194139533659 true] [17592186244852 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244854 13194139533659 true] [17592186244852 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244855 13194139533659 true] [17592186244852 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244856 13194139533659 true] [17592186244852 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244857 13194139533659 true] [17592186244852 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533659 true] [17592186244852 1041 "selection" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244852 1104 #edb/ref 17592186244853 13194139533659 true] [17592186244852 1110 #uuid "0babbd9b-876f-523c-866b-359f84b1571f" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244853 1034 "2cos⁡x-4sin⁡x" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244853 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244853 1111 #uuid "8b98984b-f56c-5168-b7db-a8899eccf092" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244854 1034 "-4cos⁡x-2sin⁡x" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244854 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244854 1111 #uuid "b9f13c7c-7ce2-5dc1-bc01-e7abded1f4f9" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244855 1034 "2cos⁡x+4sin⁡x" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244855 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244855 1111 #uuid "e5a95266-03b6-56db-85b5-86052ed57ac2" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244856 1034 "4cos⁡x+2sin⁡x" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244856 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244856 1111 #uuid "38a2640b-0a6d-5617-bffa-be1af541ed40" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244857 1034 "4cos⁡x-2sin⁡x" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244857 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244857 1111 #uuid "64e3676a-7725-5311-ab4c-fcb74325cd9d" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244858 1017 #edb/ref 17592186244859 13194139533659 true] [17592186244858 1089 "q-1900" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244858 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533659 true] [17592186244858 1100 "What is the slope of the tangent line to the curve $y=2x-5cos⁡x$ at the point $x=\\frac{\\pi }{6}?$" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244858 1113 #uuid "0c6b9481-f9e2-5ed1-8bae-4a56b067cb7c" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244858 1138 false 13194139533659 true] [17592186244858 1145 "The slope at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ is given by the value of the derivative ${y}^{′}$ at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{6}.$ \n\nFirst, we compute the derivative, using the fact that $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(cos⁡x)=-sin⁡x.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x-5cos⁡x) \\\\  & =2-5(-sin⁡x) \\\\  & =2+5sin⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{6},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(30) & =2+5sin⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =2+5(\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =2+\\frac{5}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,  the instantaneous rate of change is $\\frac{9}{2}.$" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244859 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244860 13194139533659 true] [17592186244859 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244861 13194139533659 true] [17592186244859 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244862 13194139533659 true] [17592186244859 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244863 13194139533659 true] [17592186244859 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244864 13194139533659 true] [17592186244859 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533659 true] [17592186244859 1041 "selection" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244859 1104 #edb/ref 17592186244860 13194139533659 true] [17592186244859 1110 #uuid "6c045262-f610-57a2-9bd8-11a818f85bed" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244860 1034 "\\frac{9}{2}" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244860 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244860 1111 #uuid "c796fe0a-543b-5c5a-88c8-9207ad759677" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244861 1034 "\\frac{11}{2}" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244861 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244861 1111 #uuid "ce945f78-c26d-548f-9390-d2e628cf7