 [17592186244867 1034 "12x+sin⁡x" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244867 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244867 1111 #uuid "f17a371e-2b3c-5d91-8f89-49ff66c75afa" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244868 1034 "12x-6sin⁡x" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244868 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244868 1111 #uuid "c04ce12b-f1d7-5970-bce6-46647ad3a5e3" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244869 1034 "12x+6sin⁡x" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244869 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244869 1111 #uuid "5eacd0ca-9f60-50af-9e5f-74933217b8ff" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244870 1034 "6x+6sin⁡x" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244870 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244870 1111 #uuid "a49d9394-7b0e-57f6-86f1-17de0012ecd0" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244871 1034 "12x-sin⁡x" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244871 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244871 1111 #uuid "6731952a-73be-5d10-b026-039cb8ebec1b" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244872 1017 #edb/ref 17592186244873 13194139533659 true] [17592186244872 1089 "q-341383" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244872 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533659 true] [17592186244872 1100 "Find the derivative of $y=\\frac{5sin⁡x}{4}+\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244872 1113 #uuid "54ef3535-0aa2-5693-b755-d7a098606d17" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244872 1138 false 13194139533659 true] [17592186244872 1145 "We know that $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(sin⁡x)=cos⁡x.$ Applying this formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{5sin⁡x}{4}+\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{4}(cos⁡x)+\\frac{1}{4}(4{x}^{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{5cos⁡x}{4}+{x}^{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244873 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244874 13194139533659 true] [17592186244873 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533659 true] [17592186244873 1041 "field-1" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244873 1104 #edb/ref 17592186244874 13194139533659 true] [17592186244873 1110 #uuid "ce2c24aa-31e7-53b2-8b56-7dd94cd85a12" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244874 1034 "\\frac{5}{4}\\cos(x)+x^3" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244874 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244874 1111 #uuid "ccce87b2-0766-500c-8414-f648f6726d12" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244875 1017 #edb/ref 17592186244876 13194139533659 true] [17592186244875 1089 "q-341495" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244875 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533659 true] [17592186244875 1100 "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ if $f(x)=4\\sqrt{x}+3tan⁡x.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244875 1113 #uuid "5608b24e-7159-5566-90c7-2003d5959623" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244875 1138 false 13194139533659 true] [17592186244875 1145 "We know that $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(tan⁡x)={sec}^{2}⁡x.$ Applying these formulas, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4\\sqrt{x}+3tan⁡x) \\\\  & =4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x})+3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(tan⁡x) \\\\  & =4(\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}})+3({sec}^{2}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}}+3{sec}^{2}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244876 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244877 13194139533659 true] [17592186244876 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533659 true] [17592186244876 1041 "field-1" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244876 1104 #edb/ref 17592186244877 13194139533659 true] [17592186244876 1110 #uuid "d1509a4e-c4bc-569a-be74-614721eda6b5" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244877 1034 "\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}}+3\\sec(x)^2" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244877 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244877 1111 #uuid "6bba6895-6436-5723-9758-c63204e1959f" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244878 1017 #edb/ref 17592186244879 13194139533659 true] [17592186244878 1089 "q-341858" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244878 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533659 true] [17592186244878 1100 "Find the slope of $y=tan⁡x+2sin⁡x$ at $x=0.$\n\n${y}^{′}(0)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244878 1113 #uuid "c5ceacfb-0eee-5781-840a-3727ebed8da2" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244878 1138 false 13194139533659 true] [17592186244878 1145 "We know that $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(tan⁡x)={sec}^{2}⁡x$ and $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(sin⁡x)=cos⁡x.$ Applying these formulas, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(tan⁡x+2sin⁡x) \\\\  & ={sec}^{2}⁡x+2cos⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(0) & ={sec}^{2}⁡(0)+2cos⁡(0) \\\\  & =1+2(1) \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope is $3.$" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244879 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244880 13194139533659 true] [17592186244879 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533659 true] [17592186244879 1041 "field-1" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244879 1104 #edb/ref 17592186244880 13194139533659 true] [17592186244879 1110 #uuid "be3de561-fe41-5342-89ad-3e4863540484" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244880 1034 "3" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244880 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533659 true] [17592186244880 1111 #uuid "d590af61-ad2f-5ece-8675-c834a6a40aa9" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244881 1017 #edb/ref 17592186244882 13194139533659 true] [17592186244881 1089 "q-47983" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244881 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533659 true] [17592186244881 1100 "Find the derivative of $y=\\sqrt{x}+tan⁡x.$" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244881 1113 #uuid "56dc1610-9762-5610-97fa-b88fd7b92784" 13194139533659 true] [17592186244881 1138 false 13194139533659 true] [17592186244881 1145 "We know that $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(tan⁡x)={sec}^{2}⁡x.$ Applying this formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x}+tan⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}+